23	// Ordinary first registration stays intact: a plain path missing just the
24	// registry file, or missing not-yet-created ordinary parent directories,
25	// still yields an empty version-1 registry with existed == false; a valid
26	// directory link into a real directory behaves the same when the registry
27	// file is merely absent, and mixed with ".." it finds the real file.
